  1000 pages at a flat 258 tokens/page. Pages are cheap; TOKENS are the binding cost (~800 per page),
  which is why the budget is a spend decision and there is a hard stop at 28 MB.
  Cursor immunity holds: a cursor wandering a still page for 12 s is ONE page out of 96 samples, a
  caret is none. Price: ~144k tokens for a 97 s UI take vs ~2.3M for the same take as video frames,
